<title>NORWAY: PGS ADS listing approved for trade on NYSE.</title>
<headline>PGS ADS listing approved for trade on NYSE.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Norwegian offshore services and seismic company Petroleum Geo-Services ASA said on Thursday its American Depositary Shares (ADS) would begin trading on the New York Stock Exchange from April 16.</p>
<p>Each ADS represents one ordinary share par value five crowns.</p>
<p>The ADS will trade under the symbol PGO. The company's ordinary share will continue to trade on the Oslo bourse under the symbol PGS.</p>
<p>--Oslo newsroom, +47 22 42 50 41</p>
</text>
